   "text": "** \ud83d\udcf1 DASHBOARD (JOSHI)\nGr\u00fcn 12 \u00b7 Orange 2 \u00b7 Rot 1 \u00b7 OOS 1\nChips: F\u00e4llig jetzt | \u226414 Tage | OOS\n\nKettens\u00e4ge SG-01 \u2014 ORANGE\nf\u00e4llig in 5 Tagen",
